<div class="mandarin-hanzi">同学</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">tóngxué</div>

''Meaning:'' classmate; fellow student; address among classmates  
''Part of speech:'' noun; form of address

!! In context
我的同学住在附近。 — Wǒ de tóngxué zhù zài fùjìn. — My classmate lives nearby.

!! Usage note
Means 'classmate' or 'fellow student' and can also be a form of address. 同学们 (tóngxuémen) may address a group of students.
